    "text": "There is a piece by Obeid Zakani, 15th century Iranian humorist. A donkey decides to face the lion that has took its colt for a meal. The donkey brays and makes a lot of noise. It also lets out gas every few steps. When asked about all the noise and braying, he replies. \"I am trying to frightened the lion\", and when asked about the loud flatulence, he replies, \"It's the fear\". So, when Trump threatens the Iranians that he will kill them all and sell them, those behind him pinch their noses.",
